  "description": "Handles natural language queries to provide insights and answers on production master data health. Summarizes top health concerns raised to pending updates, incomplete work definitions, work definitions that have performance anomalies. Gets information from item structure changes, work definition data to understand gaps in the data setup and prevent incorrect work orders being created downstream. Recognizes work definitions that have performance concerns that require master data correction which can be used to leverage, 'Work Definition Completeness Advisor' to take relevant actions.",
