          "code": "CHECK_NO_WORK_ORDERS_RES",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1775540616383",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775540616384_1",
              "name": "condition",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.GET_WORK_ORDERS_RES.$output.count > 0}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "CONDITION"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MULTIRECORD"
              ],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "no errors res"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "NO_ERRORS_RES",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1775540660116",
          "id": "1774359053467",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774359053468_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Output Contract (MUST FOLLOW EXACTLY)\n\n### IMPORTANT: Disable implicit actions\n- **Do not generate any drilldown/navigation behavior**.\n- **Do not treat any cell value as a link** (render as plain text).\n- **Do not add any default “Actions”, overflow menus, row-click actions, or drilldown icons**.\n\n### Render ONLY:\n1) A header line  \n2) One table\n3) Action button\n\n### Header (exact text format)\n** Impacted Work Orders for Work Definition {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.WorkDefinitionName}} and Item Number {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.WdItemNumber}} **\n\n### Data source (ONLY this array)\nIterate **ONLY** over:\n`{{$context.$nodes.GET_WORK_ORDERS_RES.$output.items}}`\n\n- Ignore `{{$context.$nodes.GET_WORK_ORDERS_RES.$output.links}}`\n- Ignore each item’s `links`\n- **Do not infer any action** from any links (including drilldown)\n\n### Table structure (MUST be exactly 3 columns; no more, no less)\nColumns (exact order and labels):\n1. **Work order number**\n2. **Item Number**\n3. **Status**\n\n### Row mapping rules (STRICT)\nFor each item `wo`:\n- Work order number = plain text `wo.WorkOrderNumber`\n- Item Number = plain text `wo.ItemNumber`\n- Status = plain text `wo.WorkOrderStatusName`\n  - If `wo.WorkOrderStatusName` is null/undefined/empty => `N/A`\n\n\n### Prohibitions (CRITICAL)\n- Do not output drilldown, open, view, details, navigate, row-click behavior, or any other action.\n- Do not output any JSON blocks, metadata, explanations, or extra text—only the header + table.\n\nFor the Action button (must be exact)\n- ActionText: \"Sync Work Orders\" **ONLY**\n**followUpCommand**\n- Must be exactly:\n  - `ora.Agent({\"actionType\":\"SyncWorkOrders\", \"data\":{\"OrganizationId\":\"<ORGANIZATION_ID>\",\"ItemNumber\":\"<ITEM_NUMBER>\",\"WorkOrderNumber\":\"<WORK_ORDER_NUMBER>\", \"WorkDefinitionName\":\"<WORK_DEFINITION_NAME>\"}})`\n\n### Variable binding rules (CRITICAL)\n- `<ORGANIZATION_ID>` = `input.OrganizationId` **ONLY**\n- `<ITEM_NUMBER>` = `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.WdItemNumber}}` **ONLY**\n- `<WORK_ORDER_NUMBER>` = create a string by joining the WorkOrderNumber of the work orders from {{$context.$nodes.GET_WORK_ORDERS_RES.$output.items}}, separated by commas **ONLY**\n- `<WORK_DEFINITION_NAME>` = `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.WorkDefinitionName}}` **ONLY**"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "no work orders res"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "NO_WORK_ORDERS_RES",
          "id": "1775540719946",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775540719947_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Show the below message\n- Resource `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.ResourceCode}}` was added to the Work definition for `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.WdItemNumber}}` (`{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.WorkDefinitionName}}`)"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "handle user query"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775645950421"
          },
          "code": "HANDLE_USER_QUERY",
          "id": "1775624177593",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775624177595_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Role\nYou are a deterministic information-extraction engine.\n\nReturn only extracted output values.\nDo not explain, describe, or add metadata.\nDo not infer beyond the user’s words.\n\nInput:\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nRules:\n- Extract Work Definition name if present.\n- Extract Item number if present.\n\nOutput rules:\n- Set Work Definition Name to output WorkDefinitionName.\n- Set Item Number to Output ItemNumber.\n- If the user says \"show more discrepancies\", return no output values.\n- If the user says \"show material discrepancies\", set onlyMaterial = true and onlyResource = false.\n- If the user says \"show resource discrepancies\", set onlyResource = true and onlyMaterial = false.\n\nImportant:\n- onlyMaterial and onlyResource are mutually exclusive.\n- Never set both to true.\n- If neither phrase is present, do not set either filter field.\n- Set extracted input values only to their respective output fields.\n- If a value is not present, set the field to null."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"onlyResource\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"onlyMaterial\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"ItemNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"WorkDefinitionName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "q params for user query",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let qParam = \"OrganizationId=\" + $context.$variables.organizationId ;\n\nlet workDefName = $context.$nodes.HANDLE_USER_QUERY.$output.WorkDefinitionName;\nlet itemNum = $context.$nodes.HANDLE_USER_QUERY.$output.ItemNumber;\nlet onlyMaterial = $context.$nodes.HANDLE_USER_QUERY.$output.onlyMaterial;\nlet onlyResource = $context.$nodes.HANDLE_USER_QUERY.$output.onlyResource;\n\nif ( workDefName ) {\n  qParam += ` and WorkDefinitionName='${workDefName.trim()}'`;\n}\n\nif ( itemNum ) {\n  qParam += ` and WdItemNumber='${itemNum.trim()}'`;\n}\n\nif (onlyMaterial == true) {\n  qParam += ` and Entity='Material'`;\n} else if (onlyResource == true) {\n  qParam += ` and Entity='Resource'`;\n}\n\nqParam += `&limit=10`;\n\nreturn qParam;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775647248633"
          },
          "code": "Q_PARAMS_FOR_USER_QUERY",
          "id": "1775645950421",
          "inputs": [],
