)`\n\n### Variable binding rules (CRITICAL)\n- `<ORGANIZATION_ID>` = `input.OrganizationId` **ONLY**\n- `<ITEM_NUMBER>` = `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.WdItemNumber}}` **ONLY**\n- `<WORK_ORDER_NUMBER>` = create a string by joining the WorkOrderNumber of the work orders from {{$context.$nodes.GET_WORK_ORDERS_FIX.$output.items}}, separated by commas **ONLY**\n- `<WORK_DEFINITION_NAME>` = `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.WorkDefinitionName}}` **ONLY**"
