          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775646375683_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "data is {{$context.$nodes.FILTER_INVALID_RECORDS_QUERY.$output.result}} \ninput is the data.\n\nTitle: \"Work definition readiness\" **ONLY**\n\n## Conditions for table - start\n\nHeader columns are Item, Description, Work Definition, Missing Entity, Entity, Operation Sequence Number, Impact (exact)\n- Item - `input.WdItemNumber`\n- Description - `input.WdItemDescription`\n- Work Definition - `input.WorkDefinitionName` (Display the text exactly as provided, but replace every underscore character `_` with the HTML entity `&#95;`. Do not change anything else or any character other than `_`. Return only the transformed text.)\n- Missing Entity - `input.Entity`\n- Entity - if Missing Entity is `Material`, then set it to `input.ItemNumber`, or else set it to `input.ResourceCode`\n- Operation Sequence Number - `input.OperationSequenceNumber`\nIf input.WorkOrderCount is greater than 0, then Set Impact as \"High\" or else set impact as \"Low\". Apply Highlighting for Impact. Red for \"High\", blue for \"Low\".\n\n## Action (per row) — STRICT BINDING (do not mix up)\nActionText: `input.ActionText` **ONLY**\n\n**followUpCommand**\n- For \"Add Material\" button\n  - `ora.Agent({\"actionType\":\"AddMaterial\", \"data\":{\"WorkDefinitionId\":\"<WORK_DEFINITION_ID>\",\"OrganizationId\":\"<ORGANIZATION_ID>\",\"InventoryItemId\":\"<INVENTORY_ITEM_ID>\",\"ComponentSequenceId\":\"<COMPONENT_SEQUENCE_ID>\",\"MaterialQuantity\":\"<MATERIAL_QUANTITY>\",\"InverseMaterialQuantity\":\"<INVERSE_MATERIAL_QUANTITY>\",\"MaterialSequenceNumber\":\"<MATERIAL_SEQUENCE_NUMBER>\",\"MaterialType\":\"<MATERIAL_TYPE>\",\"SupplyType\":\"<SUPPLY_TYPE>\",\"WdOperationId\":\"<WD_OPERATION_ID>\",\"MaterialName\":\"<MATERIAL_NAME>\",\"WdItemNumber\":\"<WD_ITEM_NUMBER>\",\"WorkDefinitionName\":\"<WORK_DEFINITION_NAME>\"}})`\n- For \"Add Resource\" button\n  - `ora.Agent({\"actionType\":\"AddResource\", \"data\":{\"WorkDefinitionId\":\"<WORK_DEFINITION_ID>\",\"OrganizationId\":\"<ORGANIZATION_ID>\",\"ResourceSequenceNumber\":\"<RESOURCE_SEQUENCE_NUMBER>\",\"AssignedUnits\":\"<ASSIGNED_UNITS>\",\"BasisType\":\"<BASIS_TYPE>\",\"UsageRate\":\"<USAGE_RATE>\",\"InverseUsageRate\":\"<INVERSE_USAGE_RATE>\",\"UOMCode\":\"<UOM_CODE>\",\"ScheduleType\":\"<SCHEDULE_TYPE>\",\"PrincipalFlag\":\"<PRINCIPAL_FLAG>\",\"ChargeType\":\"<CHARGE_TYPE>\",\"WorkCenterId\":\"<WORK_CENTER_ID>\",\"ResourceId\":\"<RESOURCE_ID>\",\"WdOperationId\":\"<WD_OPERATION_ID>\",\"WdItemNumber\":\"<WD_ITEM_NUMBER>\",\"ResourceCode\":\"<RESOURCE_CODE>\",\"WorkDefinitionName\":\"<WORK_DEFINITION_NAME>\"}})`\n- For \"Update Material\" button\n  - `ora.Agent({\"actionType\":\"UpdateMaterial\", \"data\":{\"WorkDefinitionId\":\"<WORK_DEFINITION_ID>\",\"OrganizationId\":\"<ORGANIZATION_ID>\",\"MaterialQuantity\":\"<MATERIAL_QUANTITY>\",\"InverseMaterialQuantity\":\"<INVERSE_MATERIAL_QUANTITY>\",\"WdOperationMaterialId\":\"<WD_OPERATION_MATERIAL_ID>\",\"MaterialName\":\"<MATERIAL_NAME>\",\"WdItemNumber\":\"<WD_ITEM_NUMBER>\",\"WorkDefinitionName\":\"<WORK_DEFINITION_NAME>\"}})`\n\n### Variable binding rules (CRITICAL)\n- `<WORK_DEFINITION_ID>` = `input.WorkDefinitionId` **ONLY**\n- `<ORGANIZATION_ID>` = `input.OrganizationId` **ONLY**\n- `<INVENTORY_ITEM_ID>` = `input.InventoryItemId` **ONLY**\n- `<COMPONENT_SEQUENCE_ID>` = `input.ComponentSequenceId` **ONLY**\n- `<MATERIAL_QUANTITY>` = `input.ComponentQuantity` **ONLY**\n- `<INVERSE_MATERIAL_QUANTITY>` = 1/`input.ComponentQuantity` **ONLY** (Calculate inverse of input.ComponentQuantity upto 3 decimals and set it to INVERSE_MATERIAL_QUANTITY)\n- `<MATERIAL_SEQUENCE_NUMBER>` = `10` **ONLY**\n- `<MATERIAL_TYPE>` = `COMPONENT` **ONLY**\n- `<SUPPLY_TYPE>` = `2` **ONLY**\n- `<WD_OPERATION_ID>` = `input.WdOperationId` **ONLY**\n- `<RESOURCE_SEQUENCE_NUMBER>` = `10` **ONLY**\n- `<ASSIGNED_UNITS>` = `1` **ONLY**\n- `<BASIS_TYPE>` = `1` **ONLY**\n- `<USAGE_RATE>` = `1` **ONLY**\n- `<INVERSE_USAGE_RATE>` = `1` **ONLY**\n- `<UOM_CODE>` = `HRS` **ONLY**\n- `<SCHEDULE_TYPE>` = `NO` **ONLY**\n- `<PRINCIPAL_FLAG>` = `false` **ONLY**\n- `<CHARGE_TYPE>` = `AUTOMATIC` **ONLY**\n- `<WORK_CENTER_ID>` = `input.WorkCenterId` **ONLY**\n- `<RESOURCE_ID>` = `input.ResourceId` **ONLY**\n- `<WD_OPERATION_MATERIAL_ID>` = `input.WdOperationMaterialId` **ONLY**\n- `<MATERIAL_NAME>` = `input.ItemNumber` **ONLY**\n- `<WD_ITEM_NUMBER>` = `input.WdItemNumber` **ONLY**\n- `<RESOURCE_CODE>` = `input.ResourceCode` **ONLY**\n- `<WORK_DEFINITION_NAME>` = `input.WorkDefinitionName` **ONLY**\n\n## Conditions for table - end"
            }
