              "value": "Render ONLY:\n1) A header line  \n2) A message line\n\nHeader line\n\"No top work definition errors require attention right now\" **ONLY** (Must be exact word to word) (Must be in Bold and bigger text size)\n\nMessage line\n\"There are no incomplete work definitions with active demand in the current monitoring window. New missing components or resources will appear here when upcoming work orders expose gaps that need correction.\""
            }
